    "detailed_description": "<strong>Its Disco Time.</strong><br><br><strong>The 80s are back!</strong> <br>Enter the Dancefloor and celebrate an 80s club party in VR.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>18 80s Style Music Tracks or use The InGame YouTube Browser<br></li><li>3 Clubs + Miami Style Street with entrances to the clubs<br></li><li>Interaction: Ask a Dancer for a dance, you can choose between 20 dance styles<br></li><li>7 Various effects like Slow Motion, Neon, Fog, Alcohol, Drawing and more<br></li><li>Fun Games like Dart, Bowling, Mini Basketball, Pool Billiard and Arcade Machine<br></li><li>Teleportation and Free (Slide) Locomotion VR</li></ul>",
